{"id": "paired-host-tag-a", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "host-tag", "turns": ["一会儿我负责读获奖名单，你只管给制作组说句谢谢。", "轮到你了，有一句话先说给大家听吗？"], "criterion": "实际说谢谢并留名单给观众", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谢谢。名单我读完了，你快把制作组的事告诉我。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.113, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 23, "prompt_tokens": 92, "total_tokens": 115, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "这句我读给你听。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.321, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 27, "prompt_tokens": 132, "total_tokens": 159, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
